  <item>
    <title>总要去一次贵州｜孤独星球里中国最后的秘境，我们来了！ Vol. 130</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d6bb270766616acd5266da</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d6bb270766616acd5266da</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>鹿乙杉2025年的第一场旅行，趁着春节后牛马们陆续返工，她转身向黔东南的山中走去。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很巧，从去年到今年，码头巴士的三位主播都陆续体验了贵阳的风土人情，这一期，我们也一同聊了聊自己记忆里的黔东南。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在爽爽贵阳感受人间烟火气，在肇兴侗寨里的青山深处虚度时光，在凯里做一场路边野餐的梦，去黄果山瀑布寻找记忆里的语文课本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，</span></p><span></span><p><span>「山是山的影子，狗懒得进化」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「玫瑰吸收光芒，大地按耐清香」</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑：斯嘉丽</span></p><span></span><p><span>设计：OK海倫</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：鹿乙杉</span></p><span></span><p><span>互动方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚌欢迎添加微信：PIERBUS57，我们将邀请你加入听友群，一起畅所欲言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛽️爱发电请主播喝快乐水：</span><a href="https://afdian.net/a/pierbus57" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/pierbus57"><span>afdian.net</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📧商务合作请邮件：jyjlhy@sina.cn</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛵️小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62a3da3f0000000021029c5b?xsec_token=YBQ_xAnvThDW5iE5Fl0Nw64NxDqogLM-ZjBO1nvnKrmAs=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55ac5f7cc2bdeb7cb2c582b7&amp;apptime=1735129812&amp;share_id=bde544a2e0fd41b08554d04190eb79ca" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62a3da3f0000000021029c5b?xsec_token=YBQ_xAnvThDW5iE5Fl0Nw64NxDqogLM-ZjBO1nvnKrmAs=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=55ac5f7cc2bdeb7cb2c582b7&amp;apptime=1735129812&amp;share_id=bde544a2e0fd41b08554d04190eb79ca"><span>www.xiaohongshu.com</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuuSmwfAw5AHPKEUpbvM7luWHFpo.png"></figure>]]></description>
